---
source: crates/trestle/tests/state_cli.rs
expression: "home.json(&[\"var\", \"list\", \"demo/dev\", \"--json\"], \"vars\")"
---
[
  {
    "name": "EMPTY",
    "scope": "environment",
    "value": ""
  },
  {
    "name": "LOG",
    "scope": "environment",
    "value": "info"
  },
  {
    "name": "TOKEN",
    "scope": "environment",
    "secret": {
      "key": "[id]/TOKEN",
      "provider": "keychain"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "DRAFT_PW",
    "scope": "draft",
    "secret": {
      "key": "[id]@r2/DRAFT_PW",
      "provider": "keychain"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "FEATURE",
    "scope": "draft",
    "value": "on"
  }
]
